{"id":"n73361-1-9","stage":5,"title":"장시간 · 长时间","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n73361-1-9-1","ko":"하루 종일 걸어 다녔더니 다리에 힘이 없어.","zh":"我一整天都在走路，现在腿都没力气了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하루","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}},{"text":"종일","meaning":"整天，一天到晚","explanation":"종일：整天，一天到晚","readings":[{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91758","senseId":"1","lemma":"종일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}},{"text":"걸어","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸어","audio":"/audio/55801633d067934e827a.mp3"}},{"text":"다녔더니","meaning":"来往，走遍，","explanation":"다니다：来往，走遍，；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"4","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녔더니","audio":"/audio/ba927dd5a55f4f8f7b7f.mp3"}},{"text":"다리에","meaning":"腿，下肢","explanation":"다리：腿，下肢；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"다리","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62840","senseId":"1","lemma":"다리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다리에","audio":"/audio/11543b5d5d19ed349de4.mp3"}},{"text":"힘이","meaning":"力量，力气","explanation":"힘：力量，力气；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"힘","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28633","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘이","audio":"/audio/748f97ff6aa7a31c4ea0.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"从晚上12点到第二天晚上12点的24个小时。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"02f69fc1875bf310","term":"종일","zh":"整天，一天到晚","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3","entryId":"91758","definition":"从早晨到夜晚的时间段。","pronunciation":["종일"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"来往，走遍，","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"到处走动。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"982037b144c2b329","term":"다리","zh":"腿，下肢","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3","entryId":"62840","definition":"人或动物身体下的，做站、走、跳的动作的身体部位。","pronunciation":["다리"]},{"id":"68de24edc341fabd","term":"힘","zh":"力量，力气","audio":"/audio/68de24edc341fabd21d4.mp3","entryId":"28633","definition":"人或动物自己运动或使其他事物移动的肌肉作用。","pronunciation":["힘"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7dc6842534b6caa3a5d9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73361-1-9-2","ko":"장시간 걷는다고 운동이 되는 건 아니야.","zh":"长时间走路并不等于是在锻炼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"장시간","meaning":"长时间","explanation":"장시간：长时间","readings":[{"term":"장시간","audio":"/audio/f8228e01177588a4f038.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73361","senseId":"1","le