67","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"换成或变成别的。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/0425e9e98e9b552d94fc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.222,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=73361","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":174,"sequenceScore":3.6987,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["长时间走路并不等于是在锻炼。","承奎，我听说你要去留学了，什么时候出发啊？","我一整天都在走路，现在腿都没力气了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["长时间走路并不等于是在锻炼。","我一整天都在走路，现在腿都没力气了。","承奎，我听说你要去留学了，什么时候出发啊？"],"answer":0}]}
